{"beat_id": "CH03_B06_L0047", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "Oh, that's ugly.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[THE SEAL PROBLEM]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_06_SCHOLAR_IN_REDACTED_STACKS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 151}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B06_L0048", "speaker_id": "torren", "text": "Custody record has no clean gap.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[THE SEAL PROBLEM]", "source_speaker_label": "TORREN", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_06_SCHOLAR_IN_REDACTED_STACKS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 153}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B06_L0049", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "Record. Important word.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[THE SEAL PROBLEM]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_06_SCHOLAR_IN_REDACTED_STACKS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 157}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B06_L0050", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "A clean record proves the record is clean. It does not prove nobody got access, nobody lied, nobody copied an entry, nobody trusted the wrong person, or that physical access was even required. Those are separate claims and people keep fucking them together because paperwork looks respectable. No—fucking together implies they produce something coherent. They don't. They just end up in the same bed.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[THE SEAL PROBLEM]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_06_SCHOLAR_IN_REDACTED_STACKS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 161}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B06_L0051", "speaker_id": "torren", "text": "Agreed.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[THE SEAL PROBLEM]", "source_speaker_label": "TORREN", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_06_SCHOLAR_IN_REDACTED_STACKS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 163}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B06_L0052", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "Oh.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[THE SEAL PROBLEM]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_06_SCHOLAR_IN_REDACTED_STACKS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 167}},
