{"beat_id": "CH03_B06_L0071", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "Trigger a smaller response before anything opens. If it does, we learn from that. If it doesn't, then I was wrong and we revise instead of dragging the fucking corpse of a bad idea around because we liked it alive. Grim. Accurate, though.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[THE BARRIER]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_06_SCHOLAR_IN_REDACTED_STACKS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 225}},
